href=\"?note=6c973042c939008f\" title=\"17-df-cardinal-saturation\">17-df-cardinal-saturation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"de1a11e45b1a5282\" href=\"?note=de1a11e45b1a5282\" title=\"17-thm-compactness\">17-thm-compactness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b6e4a36b436c9b93\" href=\"?note=b6e4a36b436c9b93\" title=\"17-df-ordinals-finiteness\">17-df-ordinals-finiteness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0c4dd6e6f689f962\" href=\"?note=0c4dd6e6f689f962\" title=\"17-df-cardinal-arithmetic\">17-df-cardinal-arithmetic</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\">\\(\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\)</span>，载体记作 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=|\\mathfrak A|\">\\(A=|\\mathfrak A|\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" href=\"?note=fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" title=\"17-df-structure\">17-df-structure</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Saturated}_\\kappa\">\\(\\operatorname{Saturated}_\\kappa\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"6c973042c939008f\" href=\"?note=6c973042c939008f\" title=\"17-df-cardinal-saturation\">17-df-cardinal-saturation</a> 的含有限基数版本；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite}\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span> 取所列集合论依赖。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite}(A)\\quad\\leftrightarrow\\quad\n\\forall\\kappa\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\to\\operatorname{Saturated}_\\kappa(\\mathfrak A)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Finite}(A)\\quad\\leftrightarrow\\quad\n\\forall\\kappa\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\to\\operatorname{Saturated}_\\kappa(\\mathfrak A)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Proposition 5.1.2(ii)，印刷 p.293，DjVu309，陈述与证明已读。若有限模型中的一个型未被实现，为每个载体元素挑选一个该元素不满足的型内公式；有限多个公式组成不一致的有限子型，矛盾。反之，若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 无限，在全部元素命名的语言中，要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 不等于每个命名元素的公式集具有有限满足性；由紧致性可扩张为完全型，它在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\">\\(\\mathfrak A\\)</span> 内不能实现。因此 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\">\\(\\mathfrak A\\)</span> 不具有载体基数后继处的饱和性。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"fdac06af5a7f3bb5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-cardinal-saturation","status":"resolved","id":"6c973042c939008f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-cardinal-saturation]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-thm-compactness","status":"resolved","id":"de1a11e45b1a5282","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-thm-compactness]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-ordinals-finiteness","status":"resolved","id":"b6e4a36b436c9b93","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-ordinals-finiteness]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-cardinal-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"0c4dd6e6f689f962","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-cardinal-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"fdac06af5a7f3bb5","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文